### The JPA demo. Start Postgres and pgAdmin first: docker compose up -d
### Then: ./gradlew bootRun --args='--spring.profiles.active=local'

### 1. A derived query: findByVenueCityIgnoreCase, in the log as a select with a where
GET http://localhost:8085/events?city=cluj

### 2. A write: a booking on Rock Night (the log shows the select, then the inserts and the update)
POST http://localhost:8085/events/rock-cluj/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerEmail": "ana@mail.ro", "seats": 2}

### 3. More bookings, on the other two events
POST http://localhost:8085/events/jazz-cluj/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerEmail": "ion@mail.ro", "seats": 4}

### 4.
POST http://localhost:8085/events/opera-iasi/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerEmail": "maria@mail.ro", "seats": 3}

### 5. N+1: one select for the bookings, then one per event
GET http://localhost:8085/bookings/seats-per-event

### 6. The fix: one select with a join
GET http://localhost:8085/bookings/seats-per-event/fetch-join
